---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms of Service - Teacher Jake" 
  currentLang="english" 
  currentTag="all"
  description="Review the Terms of Service for using Teacher Jake educational materials, interactive activities, and subdomain services."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-white p-8 md:p-12 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100 mt-8 mb-12 px-4 sm:px-8 md:px-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#06422f] mb-8 tracking-tight">Terms of Service</h1>
    
    <div class="prose prose-emerald max-w-none text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-serif">
      <p class="text-lg mb-6">Welcome to Teacher Jake. By accessing or using our website, worksheets, and interactive tools, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following terms and conditions.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mt-10 mb-4 font-sans">1. Educational Use & Licensing</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">All learning materials, worksheets, and educational content on this website are provided for educational and personal use by students, teachers, and language learners.</p>
      <p class="mb-6">Unless otherwise stated, content is licensed under the <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-700 font-semibold hover:underline">Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0)</a> license. You are free to share and adapt the material for non-commercial educational purposes with appropriate attribution.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mt-10 mb-4 font-sans">2. Interactive Tools & Activities</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">Our interactive activities, quizzes, and voice recording features operate client-side on your device. Users are responsible for ensuring their devices meet necessary web browser requirements.</p>
      <p class="mb-6">We reserve the right to modify, update, or discontinue features or learning activities at any time without prior notice.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mt-10 mb-4 font-sans">3. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">All educational resources are provided "as is" without warranty of any kind. While we strive to maintain accurate, high-quality language learning materials, Teacher Jake makes no representations regarding the complete accuracy or suitability of the content for any specific examination or curriculum.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mt-10 mb-4 font-sans">4. Third-Party Links & Content</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">Our platform may contain links to third-party resources, tools, or websites. We are not responsible for the availability, content, or practices of external third-party sites.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mt-10 mb-4 font-sans">5. Subdomain-Specific Terms of Service</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">Certain specialized services and platforms operated by Teacher Jake are hosted on dedicated subdomains. Please review the specific Terms of Service applicable to each platform:</p>
      
      <div class="my-6 p-5 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-100 font-sans space-y-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-emerald-950 text-base">Dahoot Gamified Learning</h3>
            <p class="text-emerald-800 text-sm">Terms governing interactive classroom games, live multiplayer challenges, and teacher dashboards.</p>
          </div>
          <a 
            href="https://dahoot.teacherjake.com/terms" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-800 text-white text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg shadow-xs transition-colors shrink-0"
          >
            Dahoot Terms ↗
          </a>
        </div>

        <hr class="border-emerald-200/60" />

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-emerald-950 text-base">Teacher Jake Books</h3>
            <p class="text-emerald-800 text-sm">Terms governing ebook access, CEFR-graded reader downloads, and digital library content.</p>
          </div>
          <a 
            href="https://books.teacherjake.com/terms" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-800 text-white text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg shadow-xs transition-colors shrink-0"
          >
            Books Terms ↗
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mt-10 mb-4 font-sans">6. Contact Information</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">If you have any questions regarding these Terms of Service, please visit our <a href="/contact" class="text-emerald-700 font-semibold hover:underline">Contact Page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
